      "title": "Diction and Lyrics",
      "level": 1,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "markdown",
          "text": "**Track:** singing | **Difficulty:** 2/10 | **Time:** ~10 min"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "overview",
      "title": "Overview",
      "level": 2,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "markdown",
          "text": "Clear diction communicates story; sloppy consonants lose words in noisy sessions and recordings."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "consonants",
      "title": "Consonants",
      "level": 2,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "markdown",
          "text": "Articulate final consonants lightly — 't' and 'k' without glottal stops unless stylistically intended. Irish and Scots Gaelic lyrics need language coaching for authentic pronunciation."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "vowels-on-long-notes",
      "title": "Vowels on long notes",
      "level": 2,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "markdown",
          "text": "Sustain on pure vowel; place consonant at end. 'Love' = 'luh-uv' not 'luh-vuh' spread across the note."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "microphone",
      "title": "Microphone",
      "level": 2,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "markdown",
          "text": "Close-mic singing needs less consonant explosion than unamplified ballad in a hall."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "lyric-sheets",
      "title": "Lyric sheets",
      "level": 2,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "markdown",
          "text": "Know meaning, not just sounds. Storytelling improves phrasing naturally."
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
